# model-id-carrier — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml). Row state (MODEL,
# _decision) lives in rows/<id>/vars.sh, not in this table.
# id               | world | patch | env | expect               | params
carrier-present    |       |       |     | carrier-present      |
decision-unset     |       |       |     | decision-unset       |
model-empty        |       |       |     | model-empty          |
shadow-divergent   |       |       |     | shadow-divergent     |
router-adopted-bare|       |       | HARNESS=goose | router-adopted-bare  |
